<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 25 February <span class="n">6</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/albrecht-von-wallenstein"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/albrecht-von-wallenstein.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Albrecht von Wallenstein</span><span class="tp">1583–1634</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-i-of-prussia"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/frederick-i-of-prussia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Frederick I of Prussia</span><span class="tp">1657–1713</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jang-bahadur-rana"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jang-bahadur-rana.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Jang Bahadur Rana</span><span class="tp">1817–1877</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/paul-julius-reuter"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/paul-julius-reuter.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Paul Julius Reuter</span><span class="tp">1816–1899</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/william-iv-grand-duke-of-luxembourg"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/william-iv-grand-duke-of-luxembourg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">William IV, Grand Duke of Luxembourg</span><span class="tp">1852–1912</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/melville-herskovits"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Melville Herskovits</span><span class="tp">1895–1963</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
